cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  ScoringRules.jl is a port of the R `scoringRules` package, with the initial
  port generated by a large language model under human guidance. The authors
  listed here wrote and maintain the Julia package; the methods are the work
  of the R package's authors. If you use it, please cite their Journal of
  Statistical Software papers (listed under `references`) in addition to this
  software.
title: "ScoringRules.jl"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Sebastian"
    family-names: "Funk"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2842-3406"
  - given-names: "Sam"
    family-names: "Abbott"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8057-8037"
  - name: "contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/EpiAware/ScoringRules.jl"
url: "https://github.com/EpiAware/ScoringRules.jl"
license: GPL-2.0-or-later
